v/t64.5771-25/499617850_1487319006264929_6933773215135330244_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fRrcE8JUixMQ7kNvwEjwENp&_nc_oc=AdpF_5bwdu5nJjpL959MMjFTr_rnuBiz_WS6kKqSbgMp2rbDr0-jhNhD5HBIseLTcUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af504cIDboCIFx2PIFTcfZxNviIHo8dfU0gYYn5mRuQBmg&oe=6A1EDF04"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2026-05-01 183526.png", "id": "1935829020397877", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823878_1935829023731210_4138014282540294142_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8ASCR62Nhp4Q7kNvwG_3KvG&_nc_oc=AdqjSdbI2KH4LbVSF5SalmvaYjwLhRFRJO7zHBjej46Qwo3BiW8-LGc5RCvSeut4HwA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6GP4md7XfoNoJvHQ5H64B8EcB12_4t74EJoJlIbBES3w&oe=6A1EED03"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Air Distribution Systems", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Air Distribution Systems is an immersive VR training application developed by ImmerseLearn to enhance practical learning in HVAC air distribution. Designed as part of the Air Distribution Systems micro-credential program, this application enables learners to engage in realistic, scenario-based training that builds critical skills in system components, airflow management, and installation practices.\n\nThrough interactive simulations, users can explore key concepts, practice procedures, and gain confidence in a safe, controlled environment that mirrors real-world HVAC tasks. The experience is structured to reinforce theoretical knowledge through hands-on application, improving retention and job readiness.\n\nPlease note: This application is exclusively accessible to individuals enrolled in the ImmerseLearn Air Distribution Systems micro-credential program. Access is restricted and intended solely for registered learners as part of their training journey.", "short_description": "Air Distribution Systems is a VR training application from ImmerseLearn, des